WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:21.941
The next morning Jack got Milky White.

2
00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:38.118
Slowly he began walking her toward the market.

3
00:00:38.119 --> 00:00:41.403
When he was close to town, a voice rang out.

4
00:00:41.404 --> 00:00:44.351
"Good morning, Jack!"

5
00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:53.254
Jack looked around.

6
00:00:53.255 --> 00:00:57.561
A funny-looking man was waving at him.

7
00:00:57.562 --> 00:01:02.090
His blue eyes twinkled like stars.

8
00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:05.759
"How does he know my name?" Jack thought.

9
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:13.673
The strange man came closer.

10
00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:23.872
He danced around the cow.

11
00:01:23.873 --> 00:01:29.198
"Milky White is a very fine cow," the man said.

12
00:01:29.199 --> 00:01:33.524
"Where are you taking her?"

13
00:01:33.525 --> 00:01:37.614
"I am taking her to the market," Jack said.

14
00:01:37.615 --> 00:01:45.303
"She is a fine cow, but I must sell her."

15
00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:48.881
"What?" The man's face lit up.

16
00:01:48.882 --> 00:01:52.679
"You're selling her?" he asked.

17
00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.880
Jack nodded.

18
00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:59.499
The man did another little dance.

19
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.811
"This is my lucky day!" he said.

20
00:02:03.812 --> 00:02:21.160
"And yours too."

21
00:02:21.161 --> 00:02:23.796
The man held out his hand.

22
00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:25.595
Jack blinked.

23
00:02:25.596 --> 00:02:30.680
Five tiny white things lay in the man's hand.

24
00:02:30.681 --> 00:02:35.671
"Are those . . . beans?" Jack asked.

25
00:02:35.672 --> 00:02:37.809
The man grinned at Jack.

26
00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:42.821
"Of course they're beans—special beans!"

27
00:02:42.822 --> 00:02:45.434
Jack looked at the beans again.

28
00:02:45.435 --> 00:02:48.643
"They don't look special," he thought.

29
00:02:48.644 --> 00:02:53.116
"They just look like plain beans."

30
00:02:53.117 --> 00:02:56.540
"Let's make a deal," the man said.

31
00:02:56.541 --> 00:03:07.945
"I'll give you these five beans—for Milky White."

